Page ID: `settings`.
UI owner: `components/hades/pages/settings-page.tsx`; Advanced Control Plane: `control-center.tsx`; Native runtime panel: `native-runtime-panel.tsx`; Obsidian: `obsidian/pages/settings-obsidian.tsx`.
API contract: settings/profile/control/native methods in `lib/hades-api.ts`.
